{"seq":3,"slug":"bonded-own-3pl-mix","title":"保税/自营/三方仓组合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-strategy-layout/bonded-own-3pl-mix","wordCount":2289,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"保税-自营-三方仓组合\">保税/自营/三方仓组合</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-同一个城市-三种不同的资产\">核心概念：同一个城市，三种不同的资产</h2><p>选址与分仓策略回答完「建在哪、建几个、放多少库存」之后，还剩一个金额最大却最常被推给别的部门的问题：<strong>这个节点以什么形式持有</strong>。同一个城市，你可以在保税区内设一个跨境仓、可以租场地自建自营、也可以把库存交给第三方物流商（3PL）代管。三者的差别不是「谁干活」，而是现金流结构、合规义务、控制粒度三个维度的根本差异。</p>\n<p>保税仓的本质是<strong>货物尚未完成进口纳税的暂存状态</strong>。中国跨境电商零售进口的保税模式（海关监管方式代码 1210）允许货物批量进入保税区仓库、按单缴税出区，与直邮模式（9610）相比，批次清关的成本被摊薄到单件，且消费者侧的时效大幅改善。欧盟侧有一个对应的机制：进口一站式服务（IOSS）自 2021 年 7 月 1 日起可用，覆盖价值 0 到 150 欧元的进口远程销售货物，卖家在一个成员国注册即可申报全欧的增值税，海关在价值不超过 150 欧元且 IOSS 号有效时不要求即时缴纳 VAT（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Import_One-Stop_Shop\">Import One-Stop Shop</a>）。这两个例子说明同一件事：<strong>保税/递延不是仓储技术，是税收与关务制度在网络上的投影</strong>——它决定了你的库存在法律上「在境内」还是「在境外」。</p>\n<p>三种形式的差异可以压成一张对照表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>保税仓</th>\n<th>自营仓</th>\n<th>三方仓（3PL）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>库存法律状态</td>\n<td>未完成进口纳税，受海关监管</td>\n<td>已完税，自由处置</td>\n<td>视 3PL 模式，通常已完税</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前期投入</td>\n<td>中（设备+系统对接+保证金）</td>\n<td>高（场地、设备、人力）</td>\n<td>低（按件/按存储计费）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位可变成本</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（规模上去后）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可控粒度</td>\n<td>作业全可控，库存受监管约束</td>\n<td>作业全可控</td>\n<td>受对方 SLA 与优先级约束</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弹性</td>\n<td>低（扩容受监管与场地限制）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（可快速启用/退出）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>退出成本</td>\n<td>高（监管注销、库存处置）</td>\n<td>高（租约、人员、设备）</td>\n<td>低（合同期与切换期）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合场景</td>\n<td>高频高周转的跨境零售</td>\n<td>核心市场、量大且稳定</td>\n<td>新市场试水、峰值溢出、长尾区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"成本结构-什么规模下自营优于三方\">成本结构：什么规模下自营优于三方</h2><h3 id=\"盈亏平衡点\">盈亏平衡点</h3><p>三方仓与自营仓的比较是一个经典的单变量盈亏平衡问题。三方的成本近似全是可变成本：按存储体积（每立方米每月）+ 按件操作费（入库、拣货、打包、出库）；自营的成本是固定成本加较低的可变成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>3pl</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mi>C</mi><mo>∗</mo><mtext>own</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C*{\\text{3pl}}(V) = p_s V + p_o Q, \\qquad C*{\\text{own}}(V) = F + c_s V + c_o Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">3pl</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">own</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 是平均存储量、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是月出库件数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是自营的月固定成本（租金、人力、折旧、系统）。令两者相等得到平衡点：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mstyle mathcolor=\"#cc0000\"><mtext>\\*</mtext></mstyle></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^{\\*} = \\frac{F - (p_s - c_s)V}{p_o - c_o}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1324em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"color:#cc0000;\">\\*</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3074em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个式子的含义比数值更有用。<strong>分子是自营的固定成本减去可能的存储成本节省，分母是每件操作费的差额</strong>——三方的每件操作费通常显著高于自营的边际操作成本，因此分母是正的；只要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，自营就更便宜。三条推论：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 越大平衡点越高（重资产投入需要更大规模摊薄）；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_o - c_o</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越小（三方报价越便宜）平衡点越高；存储成本差额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(p_s-c_s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 若为负（三方存储报价反而更高，因为含了他们的管理毛利），会进一步抬高平衡点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"平衡点之外的三个非成本因素\">平衡点之外的三个非成本因素</h3><p>只按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^*</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 决策会漏掉三件事。<strong>其一，可变成本的确定性溢价</strong>：三方仓的成本随业务量线性变化，在业务不确定时这种「可退出」本身就是价值——用期权语言说，选择 3PL 相当于持有一个放弃权。<strong>其二，能力上限</strong>：自营仓的产能上限是刚性的（见 <a href=\"../coverage-cost-tradeoff/warehouse-capacity-peak\">仓库产能与峰值规划</a>），三方仓可以在旺季借用对方其他客户的富余产能，代价是旺季价格上浮与优先级下降。<strong>其三，数据与控制粒度</strong>：自营仓能拿到每一件商品的作业明细，三方仓通常只提供汇总报告与约定的接口字段，这对需要精细库存对账与质检数据的品类（高价值、高退货率）是硬约束。</p>\n<p>这三点的定量化方式不同：第一点用实物期权或情景加权（见 <a href=\"../network-simulation-scenario/open-close-warehouse-decision\">开仓/关仓与迁移决策</a>），第二点用峰值产能模型，第三点通常作为一票否决或加权惩罚进入评分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合策略-不是三选一\">组合策略：不是三选一</h2><p>真实网络几乎从不只用一种形式，而是按「节点在网络中的角色」分配形式。三种形式各自的最优角色是清晰的：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[新市场进入] --&gt; B{月出库量预测}&#10;  B --&gt;|&lt; 平衡点| C[三方仓&lt;br/&gt;低投入试水]&#10;  B --&gt;|&gt; 平衡点且稳定| D[自营仓&lt;br/&gt;单位成本最优]&#10;  C --&gt; E{连续 2-3 季度超平衡点?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| D&#10;  E --&gt;|否| C&#10;  D --&gt; F[保税仓&lt;br/&gt;若为跨境零售高频品类]&#10;  C --&gt; G[峰值溢出&lt;br/&gt;借用 3PL 弹性产能]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[新市场进入] --&gt; B{月出库量预测}\n  B --&gt;|&lt; 平衡点| C[三方仓&lt;br/&gt;低投入试水]\n  B --&gt;|&gt; 平衡点且稳定| D[自营仓&lt;br/&gt;单位成本最优]\n  C --&gt; E{连续 2-3 季度超平衡点?}\n  E --&gt;|是| D\n  E --&gt;|否| C\n  D --&gt; F[保税仓&lt;br/&gt;若为跨境零售高频品类]\n  C --&gt; G[峰值溢出&lt;br/&gt;借用 3PL 弹性产能]\n  D --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p><strong>新市场用三方</strong>：进入一个需求未知的市场时，投入固定资产是对未验证假设的重注。三方仓把进入成本压到接近于零，允许用真实的订单数据回答「这个市场值不值得建仓」。<strong>成熟市场用自营</strong>：量稳定且超过平衡点后，自营的单位成本优势开始累积，同时拿到作业数据与优先级控制。<strong>跨境零售高频品类用保税</strong>：保税仓把清关成本摊到单件并大幅缩短时效，但它要求商品品类稳定、合规资质齐备、且能承受监管对库存变动的约束（退换货、销毁、转口都需报关手续）。</p>\n<p>一个常被低估的组合技巧是<strong>自营 + 三方混合覆盖同一市场</strong>：自营仓承担基线量（享受单位成本优势），三方仓承担峰值溢出与长尾区域（享受弹性）。这要求分仓逻辑能识别「这个订单该走哪个形式」，通常落成以下规则——注意它是按可用库存与时效承诺判定，而不是按固定比例切分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 分仓可用性判定：自营优先，三方兜底，保税仓需满足监管条件&#10;WITH node_availability AS (&#10;  SELECT o.order_id, n.node_id, n.form, n.transit_days,&#10;         i.on_hand - i.reserved AS available, n.priority&#10;  FROM   orders o&#10;  JOIN   node_coverage nc ON nc.postal_code = o.ship_postal_code&#10;  JOIN   nodes n          ON n.node_id = nc.node_id AND n.active&#10;  JOIN   inventory i      ON i.node_id = n.node_id AND i.sku = o.sku&#10;  WHERE  n.form &lt;&gt; &#39;bonded&#39;&#10;     OR  (o.declared_value &lt;= :bonded_single_txn_cap AND o.buyer_id_verified)&#10;)&#10;SELECT order_id, node_id, form, transit_days&#10;FROM   node_availability&#10;WHERE  available &gt;= 1&#10;ORDER  BY priority ASC, transit_days ASC, available DESC&#10;LIMIT  1;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分仓可用性判定：自营优先，三方兜底，保税仓需满足监管条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> node_availability </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">form</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">transit_days</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on_hand</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reserved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> available, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">priority</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   orders o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   node_coverage nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">postal_code</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ship_postal_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   nodes n          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">active</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   inventory i      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">node_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sku</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  n</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">form</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bonded'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     OR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">declared_value</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> :bonded_single_txn_cap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">buyer_id_verified</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, node_id, form, transit_days</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   node_availability</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER  BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> priority ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, transit_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ASC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, available </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LIMIT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条查询里有两个必须显式建模的约束。<code>:bonded_single_txn_cap AND o.buyer_id_verified</code> 是保税仓的前置条件——保税模式对单笔交易金额与购买人身份有监管要求，具体限额由监管口径给出（中国跨境电商零售进口的保税模式即海关监管方式 1210），未满足时必须落到已完税节点，这条规则不能由下游「出错了再改单」补救。<code>ORDER BY priority</code> 让自营仓优先被选择，但这只在时效相当的前提下成立：如果自营仓的 <code>transit_days</code> 明显劣于三方仓，优先级的权重就应当低于时效——两者谁先谁后取决于品类对时效的敏感度，是本 hub 第二章第 1 篇要量化的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"组合决策的落地纪律\">组合决策的落地纪律</h2><p>三条纪律可以显著减少组合策略的事后返工。<strong>容量口径要区分形式</strong>：保税仓的可售库存受监管状态影响（在区内、已出区待发、待检是不同状态），三方仓的在库数来自对方接口且更新延迟不可控，自营仓的库存最准；统一到「可承诺库存」这个口径之前，任何跨形式的分配算法都会给出错误结论。<strong>合同期限要与规划周期匹配</strong>：自营仓的租约通常三到五年，而网络规划的假设有效期很少超过两年，两者的错配是关仓决策中最贵的沉没成本来源。<strong>退出路径要在进入时写好</strong>：保税仓的监管注销流程、自营仓的人员安置与设备处置、三方仓的数据导出与库存移交，这三件事在签约时谈成本极低，在退出时谈则极其被动。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保税/自营/三方的差别在现金流结构、合规义务、控制粒度三个维度，而不是「谁来干活」。</li>\n<li>保税仓与 VAT 递延机制是税收与关务制度在网络上的投影，它决定库存在法律上「在境内还是境外」。</li>\n<li>三方与自营的平衡点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>Q</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q^*=\\frac{F-(p_s-c_s)V}{p_o-c_o}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4911em;vertical-align:-0.4811em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1645em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4811em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 由固定成本与每件操作费差额决定；量超过平衡点后自营更便宜。</li>\n<li>平衡点之外还有三个非成本因素：可退出性的期权价值、三方在旺季的弹性产能、以及数据与控制粒度的硬约束。</li>\n<li>组合策略按节点角色分配形式：新市场用三方试水、成熟市场用自营、跨境高频品类用保税，并用三方承接峰值溢出。</li>\n<li>落地纪律三条：统一「可承诺库存」口径、合同期限与规划周期匹配、退出路径在进入时谈定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保税/自营/三方仓组合","id":"保税-自营-三方仓组合"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：同一个城市，三种不同的资产","id":"核心概念-同一个城市-三种不同的资产"},{"level":2,"text":"成本结构：什么规模下自营优于三方","id":"成本结构-什么规模下自营优于三方"},{"level":3,"text":"盈亏平衡点","id":"盈亏平衡点"},{"level":3,"text":"平衡点之外的三个非成本因素","id":"平衡点之外的三个非成本因素"},{"level":2,"text":"组合策略：不是三选一","id":"组合策略-不是三选一"},{"level":2,"text":"组合决策的落地纪律","id":"组合决策的落地纪律"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"库存前置与分仓策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/network-strategy-layout/forward-stocking-deploy"},"next":{"title":"覆盖时效与物流成本模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/global-warehouse-network-planning/coverage-cost-tradeoff/coverage-transit-cost-model"}}